# A Claude Code composer relaid by +1 rows, with no key in flight: the box moves 400 ms after the
# last key. The agent list under the bottom-anchored box goes from 1 to 0 rows, so the whole
# screen is redrawn in one synchronized update with the prompt 1 row down; the transcript stays on
# the top rows and the box alone moves (the owner's relayout, PRISM-GLASS.md §7). Typing then goes
# on at the new row.

